{
  "sourceLanguage" : "en",
  "strings" : {
    "%@ creator · %@ DyorHQ" : {
      "comment" : "A retired Stellar Moment's split of each collect: the creator's share, then DyorHQ's (95%, 5%). DyorHQ is never translated",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "%1$@ creator · %2$@ DyorHQ"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$@ creador · %2$@ DyorHQ"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$@ créateur · %2$@ DyorHQ"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "크리에이터 %1$@ · DyorHQ %2$@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "创作者 %1$@ · DyorHQ %2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ of every collect builds the reserve. At the threshold the coin graduates into a Soroswap pool whose liquidity is locked forever." : {
      "comment" : "Under a Stellar Moment's progress bar. The value is a share of each collect (75%). Soroswap is never translated",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El %@ de cada colección forma la reserva. Al llegar al umbral, la moneda se gradúa en un pool de Soroswap cuya liquidez queda bloqueada para siempre."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ de chaque collecte alimente la réserve. Au seuil, le coin est diplômé dans un pool Soroswap dont la liquidité est verrouillée pour toujours."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "수집할 때마다 %@가 준비금으로 쌓입니다. 기준에 도달하면 코인은 유동성이 영구히 잠기는 Soroswap 풀로 졸업합니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每次收藏的 %@ 计入储备。达到门槛后，代币将毕业进入 Soroswap 池，其流动性永久锁定。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ of every collect waits here for you to withdraw. Your coins vest from graduation: 20%% then, and 16%% more each period." : {
      "comment" : "Under a Stellar Moment's creator section. The value is the creator's share of each collect (20%)",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El %@ de cada colección te espera aquí para retirarlo. Tus monedas se liberan desde la graduación: 20%% entonces y 16%% más cada periodo."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ de chaque collecte vous attend ici, à retirer. Vos coins se libèrent dès le diplôme : 20%% à ce moment, puis 16%% de plus à chaque période."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "수집할 때마다 %@가 여기에 쌓여 출금을 기다립니다. 코인은 졸업 시점부터 베스팅됩니다. 졸업 시 20%%, 이후 기간마다 16%%씩 더."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每次收藏的 %@ 在此等你提取。你的代币自毕业起归属：毕业时 20%%，之后每期再增加 16%%。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A graduation attempt failed. Anyone can try again; it graduates as soon as an attempt succeeds." : {
      "comment" : "A Stellar Moment whose graduation failed and was recorded",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Un intento de graduación falló. Cualquiera puede volver a intentarlo; se gradúa en cuanto un intento lo logre."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Une tentative de diplôme a échoué. Tout le monde peut réessayer ; il est diplômé dès qu'une tentative réussit."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "졸업 시도가 실패했습니다. 누구나 다시 시도할 수 있으며, 시도가 성공하는 즉시 졸업합니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一次毕业尝试失败。任何人都可以重试；只要有一次尝试成功即会毕业。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Can expire from" : {
      "comment" : "A row on a Stellar Moment that hasn't graduated: from when anyone can end it without graduating (a date follows)",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Puede expirar desde"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Peut expirer dès le"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "만료 가능 시점"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "可过期时间"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Collection" : {
