          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "第 %@ 版"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Edition size" : {
      "comment" : "A row on a Stellar Moment: how many editions it can have",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tamaño de la edición"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Taille de l'édition"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "에디션 수량"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "版本数量"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Freighter shows the cover image; the video plays in DyorHQ." : {
      "comment" : "A note in the Freighter sheet, for a video Moment: the wallet shows its still image only. Freighter and DyorHQ are never translated",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Freighter muestra la imagen de portada; el vídeo se reproduce en DyorHQ."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Freighter affiche l'image de couverture ; la vidéo se lit dans DyorHQ."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Freighter에는 커버 이미지가 표시되며, 동영상은 DyorHQ에서 재생됩니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Freighter 显示封面图片；视频在 DyorHQ 中播放。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Freighter, the Stellar wallet, can show this edition once you add it. You'll need the contract address and the token ID." : {
      "comment" : "The Freighter sheet's introduction. Freighter and Stellar are never translated",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Freighter, la billetera de Stellar, puede mostrar esta edición cuando la añadas. Necesitarás la dirección del contrato y el ID del token."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Freighter, le portefeuille Stellar, peut afficher cette édition une fois que vous l'avez ajoutée. Il vous faut l'adresse du contrat et l'ID du jeton."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Stellar 지갑인 Freighter에 이 에디션을 추가하면 볼 수 있습니다. 컨트랙트 주소와 토큰 ID가 필요합니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Stellar 钱包 Freighter 在你添加后即可显示此版本。你需要合约地址和代币 ID。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "From DyorHQ's first Stellar Moments contract, now retired: it can't be collected any more. Editions stay with their collectors." : {
      "comment" : "Under a retired Stellar Moment's header. DyorHQ and Stellar are never translated",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Del primer contrato de Moments de DyorHQ en Stellar, ya retirado: ya no se puede coleccionar. Las ediciones siguen con sus coleccionistas."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du premier contrat Moments de DyorHQ sur Stellar, désormais retiré : il ne peut plus être collecté. Les éditions restent à leurs collecteurs."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "DyorHQ의 첫 Stellar Moments 컨트랙트에서 발행되었으며 지금은 종료되어 더 이상 수집할 수 없습니다. 에디션은 수집가가 계속 보유합니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "来自 DyorHQ 首个 Stellar Moments 合约，现已停用：无法再收藏。版本仍归收藏者所有。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Get Freighter" : {
      "comment" : "Button in the Freighter sheet: opens Freighter's website to install the wallet. Freighter is never translated",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Obtener Freighter"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
