    "Graduation is taking longer than usual." : {
      "comment" : "A Stellar Moment that has waited over an hour to graduate",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La graduación está tardando más de lo habitual."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le diplôme prend plus de temps que d'habitude."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "졸업이 평소보다 오래 걸리고 있습니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "毕业耗时比平常更久。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If it never graduates, it can expire: %@ of its reserve goes to the creator and the rest to the DyorHQ treasury. Collectors keep their editions." : {
      "comment" : "Under a Stellar Moment's graduation: what happens if it expires instead. The value is the creator's share (70%). DyorHQ is never translated",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si nunca se gradúa, puede expirar: el %@ de su reserva va al creador y el resto a la tesorería de DyorHQ. Los coleccionistas conservan sus ediciones."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "S'il n'est jamais diplômé, il peut expirer : %@ de sa réserve va au créateur et le reste à la trésorerie de DyorHQ. Les collecteurs gardent leurs éditions."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "끝내 졸업하지 못하면 만료될 수 있습니다. 준비금의 %@는 크리에이터에게, 나머지는 DyorHQ 트레저리로 갑니다. 수집가는 에디션을 그대로 보유합니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果始终未能毕业，它可以过期：储备的 %@ 归创作者，其余归 DyorHQ 金库。收藏者保留其版本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In My Moments once it settles" : {
      "comment" : "The value of the collect review's 'Your NFTs' row",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En Mis Moments en cuanto se confirme"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dans Mes Moments dès la confirmation"
