    "It ended before graduating: %@ of its reserve went to the creator and the rest to the DyorHQ treasury. Collectors keep their editions; its coin was never made." : {
      "comment" : "An expired Stellar Moment. The value is the creator's share of the reserve (70%). DyorHQ is never translated",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Terminó antes de graduarse: el %@ de su reserva fue al creador y el resto a la tesorería de DyorHQ. Los coleccionistas conservan sus ediciones; su moneda nunca se creó."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il a pris fin avant son diplôme : %@ de sa réserve est allé au créateur et le reste à la trésorerie de DyorHQ. Les collecteurs gardent leurs éditions ; son coin n'a jamais été créé."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "졸업 전에 종료되었습니다. 준비금의 %@는 크리에이터에게, 나머지는 DyorHQ 트레저리로 갔습니다. 수집가는 에디션을 보유하며, 코인은 발행되지 않았습니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它在毕业前结束：储备的 %@ 归创作者，其余归 DyorHQ 金库。收藏者保留其版本；其代币从未创建。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Name: at most 32 bytes. Accented letters and emoji count as more than one." : {
      "comment" : "Under the name field of Publish a Moment on Stellar: the name is too long for the contract",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
